      "The kit's client modules are published only where they are on this list (scripts/pack-manifest.mjs): the kit builds them module by module, with their declarations and stylesheets, for a product's bundler (config/tsconfig.kit-client.json, `@mistriwork/kit/vite`). `node scripts/check-boundary.mjs` refuses an importer's name that is not on the list or not in the package as published, and a name on the list nothing imports any more.",
      "Removing a name is a breaking change for the host: it waits for a release that says so in CHANGELOG.md (docs/boundary.md, \"The host list\")."
    ],
